# Lens (Tauri 2 + Vite + TS) — keep SOURCE, drop build output / deps / cruft.
#
# NOTE: the repo-ROOT .gitignore ignores *.html (L69), *.json (L149), *.png (L61) to keep data,
# figures, and docs out of git. Those patterns also catch this app's real source (index.html,
# tauri.conf.json, capabilities, package.json, icons …), so this deeper .gitignore RE-INCLUDES it
# via the negations below (a nested .gitignore overrides the root for files). Order matters: the
# directory-ignores above + the final ._* re-ignore bracket the negations, so build dirs and
# AppleDouble siblings can never sneak back in.

# ── Build output / dependencies (DIRECTORY-ignored — negations below can't resurface contents) ──
node_modules/
dist/
target/
src-tauri/target/
src-tauri/gen/

# ── Icon-render scratch (gen_icons.py is kept; the PNG/contact-sheet intermediates regenerate) ──
_design/icon/_*.png
_design/icon/contact_sheet.png

# ── Re-include the app SOURCE the repo-root extension-ignores would otherwise drop ──────────────
!*.html
!*.json
!src-tauri/icons/**

# ── macOS AppleDouble + Finder cruft — re-ignored LAST so the negations above never readmit a
#    ._*.json / ._*.html / ._*.png sibling the exFAT drive scatters everywhere ──────────────────
._*
.DS_Store
